  "quotes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Yeah,",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 409,
      "end": 414,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "You and me both.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 439,
      "end": 455,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "You must be the new guest.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1068,
      "end": 1094,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "That depends,",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1098,
      "end": 1111,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Does the room have a bed?",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1126,
      "end": 1151,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Usually.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1155,
      "end": 1163,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Then yes. Definitely me.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1167,
      "end": 1191,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Upstairs, then. You'll find the kettle by the window. Mind the third step. It makes a noise like a dying goose.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1490,
      "end": 1601,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "I've lived with worse.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1605,
      "end": 1627,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Oh, haven't we all.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 1631,
      "end": 1650,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Tell me what happened.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 2977,
      "end": 2999,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "He was being an idiot.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3003,
      "end": 3025,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "That's a condition, not an explanation.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3029,
      "end": 3068,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "He took my bag.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3072,
      "end": 3087,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "And you?",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3091,
      "end": 3099,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "I took it back.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3103,
      "end": 3118,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "With your face?",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3174,
      "end": 3189,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "Shut up.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3193,
      "end": 3201,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Hold still, menace.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3416,
      "end": 3435,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "You're pulling my leg off.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3439,
      "end": 3465,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Yes. That's the treatment. All doctors do it.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3469,
      "end": 3514,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "Okay. Here's the important part. If somebody bigger than you starts trouble, you don't have to stand there and prove you're fearless.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3589,
      "end": 3722,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "I wasn't scared.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3726,
      "end": 3742,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "Then you should've been. Fear can be useful.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3746,
      "end": 3790,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "Look at me, Nin. Being brave isn't the same as being stupid.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3844,
      "end": 3904,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "You're stupid.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3908,
      "end": 3922,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "Frequently. That's how I've gathered all this wisdom.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 3926,
      "end": 3979,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "Good,",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 4169,
      "end": 4174,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "text": "Can I punch you now?",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 4195,
      "end": 4215,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "text": "Absolutely not.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 4219,
      "end": 4234,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "text": "That's not my age,",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 4688,
      "end": 4706,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "text": "That's because you're a very advanced seven-year-old.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 4720,
      "end": 4773,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "text": "I'm ten.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 4777,
      "end": 4785,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "text": "Then you're an extremely immature ten-year-old. Blow it out.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 4789,
      "end": 4849,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "text": "Birthday law,",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 5133,
      "end": 5146,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "text": "You get the big piece.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 5158,
      "end": 5180,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "text": "My birthday. My rules.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 5184,
      "end": 5206,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "text": "You're becoming dangerously difficult.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 5248,
      "end": 5286,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "text": "Good teacher.",
      "part": 1,
      "start": 5290,
      "end": 5303,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "needs_alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "text": "Why are you out here?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 174,
      "end": 195,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "text": "Guard duty.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 199,
      "end": 210,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "text": "From what?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 214,
      "end": 224,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "text": "Spiders. Very serious threat.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 228,
      "end": 257,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "text": "There aren't any spiders.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 261,
      "end": 286,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "text": "Exactly. You're welcome.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 290,
      "end": 314,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "text": "One day,",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 452,
      "end": 460,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "text": "we're going to have a place with doors that only slam when we want them to.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 480,
      "end": 555,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "text": "Why would we want them to slam?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 559,
      "end": 590,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "text": "Because you'll be annoyed with me.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 594,
      "end": 628,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "I'm already annoyed with you.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 632,
      "end": 661,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "text": "See? We've got a promising future.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 665,
      "end": 699,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "text": "I know,",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1383,
      "end": 1390,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "text": "Wonderful. Saves me explaining.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1415,
      "end": 1446,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "text": "The van at work broke down.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1450,
      "end": 1477,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "text": "Did the van also break your phone?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1481,
      "end": 1515,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "text": "No. That was me being an idiot.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1519,
      "end": 1550,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "text": "Finally, a diagnosis.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1554,
      "end": 1575,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "text": "I was wrong. I'm sorry.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1610,
      "end": 1633,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "text": "Did you get extra chips?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1741,
      "end": 1765,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "text": "Do I look suicidal?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 1769,
      "end": 1788,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "text": "Didn't we agree this movie was terrible?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 2162,
      "end": 2202,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 2206,
      "end": 2210,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "text": "Why are we watching it?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 2214,
      "end": 2237,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "text": "Because you know how it ends.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 2241,
      "end": 2270,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "text": "At midnight? You don't even take this route.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 2949,
      "end": 2993,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "text": "Maybe I've developed an interest in public transport.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 2997,
      "end": 3050,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "text": "What's that?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4315,
      "end": 4327,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "text": "Rent. And a bit extra.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4331,
      "end": 4353,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "text": "I pay my own rent.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4377,
      "end": 4395,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "text": "I know.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4399,
      "end": 4406,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "text": "Then why are you paying it?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4410,
      "end": 4437,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "text": "Because you spent half your childhood eating the worst toast ever made, and I'd like to correct the historical record.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4441,
      "end": 4559,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "text": "Cass.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4595,
      "end": 4600,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "text": "Nin.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4604,
      "end": 4608,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "text": "Where did it come from?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4612,
      "end": 4635,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "text": "Work.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4639,
      "end": 4644,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "text": "What work?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4648,
      "end": 4658,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "text": "The boring kind.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4662,
      "end": 4678,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "text": "You'd complain about boring work. You complain when your socks are too boring.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4682,
      "end": 4760,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "text": "Seriously. It's fine.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4806,
      "end": 4827,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "text": "I don't need you to buy me a life.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4862,
      "end": 4896,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "text": "That's not what I'm doing.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 4970,
      "end": 4996,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "text": "Then tell me what you are doing.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 5000,
      "end": 5032,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "text": "Trying to make something easier for once.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 5127,
      "end": 5168,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "text": "What's inside?",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 5605,
      "end": 5619,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "text": "Paperwork.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 5623,
      "end": 5633,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "text": "That's an expensive courier service.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 5637,
      "end": 5673,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "text": "Then enjoy your tip.",
      "part": 2,
      "start": 5677,
      "end": 5697,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "text": "You've been very reliable,",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 745,
      "end": 771,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "text": "Is that supposed to be a compliment?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 820,
      "end": 856,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "text": "It's an opportunity to continue being reliable.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 860,
      "end": 907,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "text": "What if I'm finished?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 911,
      "end": 932,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "text": "People who are finished don't generally leave so much unfinished business.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 958,
      "end": 1032,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "text": "What's funny?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 2615,
      "end": 2628,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "text": "Nothing. You. The fact that shelving has become a combat sport.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 2646,
      "end": 2709,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "text": "No,",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 2785,
      "end": 2788,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "text": "Just wanted to hear your voice.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 2800,
      "end": 2831,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "text": "Well, you've heard it. It remains incredibly charming.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 2908,
      "end": 2962,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "text": "Debatable.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 2966,
      "end": 2976,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "text": "Come over Sunday. I'll cook.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 2980,
      "end": 3008,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "text": "Before you ask,",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3360,
      "end": 3375,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "text": "yes, the wrapping was done by a human being.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3387,
      "end": 3431,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "text": "A drunk one?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3435,
      "end": 3447,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "text": "An artist. Unappreciated in his time.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3451,
      "end": 3488,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "text": "Where did you even find this?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3781,
      "end": 3810,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "text": "I have mysterious talents.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3814,
      "end": 3840,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "text": "You have mysterious debts, probably.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3844,
      "end": 3880,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "text": "Both can be true.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 3975,
      "end": 3992,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "text": "You okay?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4290,
      "end": 4299,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4303,
      "end": 4308,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "text": "That sounded rehearsed.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4312,
      "end": 4335,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "text": "Everything's all right, Nin.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4339,
      "end": 4367,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "text": "Call me tomorrow,",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4536,
      "end": 4553,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "text": "I will.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4594,
      "end": 4601,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "text": "And don't do anything stupid.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4605,
      "end": 4634,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "text": "You're taking all my hobbies away.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4638,
      "end": 4672,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "text": "Lock up behind me, menace.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4911,
      "end": 4937,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "text": "I always do.",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 4963,
      "end": 4975,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "text": "Are you Cassian's sister?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 5680,
      "end": 5705,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "text": "Why?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 5787,
      "end": 5791,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "text": "What happened?",
      "part": 3,
      "start": 5841,
      "end": 5855,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "text": "Killed?",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 279,
      "end": 286,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "text": "I'm very sorry.",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 290,
      "end": 305,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "text": "Where?",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 309,
      "end": 315,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "text": "Was he alone?",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 335,
      "end": 348,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "text": "We're still establishing exactly what occurred.",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 362,
      "end": 409,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "text": "Did he call anyone? Did he say anything?",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 413,
      "end": 453,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "text": "We don't have that information.",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 457,
      "end": 488,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "text": "When can I see him?",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 856,
      "end": 875,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "text": "He's smiling like that because someone dared him to eat everything,",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 2239,
      "end": 2306,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "text": "He was always making people laugh.",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 2351,
      "end": 2385,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "text": "He was,",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 2558,
      "end": 2565,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "text": "About what?",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 3291,
      "end": 3302,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "text": "About Cassian.",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 3319,
      "end": 3333,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "text": "What would you like me to say?",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 3337,
      "end": 3367,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "text": "I just thought—",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 3371,
      "end": 3386,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "text": "I know what you thought.",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 3390,
      "end": 3414,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "text": "Cass, this is disgusting.",
      "part": 4,
      "start": 4974,
      "end": 4999,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "text": "Well, Cass,",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 895,
      "end": 906,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "text": "Evening.",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 2129,
      "end": 2137,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "text": "Whiskey, please.",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 2141,
      "end": 2157,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "text": "Any preference?",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 2161,
      "end": 2176,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "text": "The one that doesn't ask personal questions.",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 2180,
      "end": 2224,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "text": "That narrows it down surprisingly little.",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 2261,
      "end": 2302,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "text": "Then your favorite.",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 2306,
      "end": 2325,
      "speaker": "Ninja",
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "text": "From the man across the room.",
      "part": 5,
      "start": 2904,
      "end": 2933,
      "speaker": "Wade",
      "status": "timed"
    }
  ],
  "thoughts": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "part": 1,
      "start": 2269,
      "end": 2485,
      "text": "If I unpack, it means I'm staying. If I stay, somebody will eventually ask why I came. And what am I supposed to tell them? That I drove halfway across the country because every street back home still knows his name?",
      "voice": "Hallie",
      "absoluteGain": 0.8,
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "part": 4,
      "start": 1515,
      "end": 1710,
      "text": "You said you'd call tomorrow. You always called. I don't understand how the world can keep moving when you've stopped. I don't know what I'm supposed to do with all the things I haven't told you.",
      "voice": "Hallie",
      "absoluteGain": 0.8,
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "part": 5,
      "start": 1182,
      "end": 1337,
      "text": "Somewhere nobody knows him. That's all I asked for. One evening where I can just be the woman ordering a drink, instead of the woman with the dead brother.",
      "voice": "Hallie",
      "absoluteGain": 0.8,
      "status": "timed"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "part": 5,
      "start": 4668,
      "end": 4889,
      "text": "Who are you?\n\nYou look like the kind of man who has an answer prepared for everything, and not one of them is the truth.\n\nDon't start. Don't make somebody else's silence into your problem.\n\nSo why haven't you looked away?",
      "voice": "Hallie",
      "absoluteGain": 0.8,
      "status": "timed"
    }
  ]
}